---Decorative component that provides functionality for drawing arbitrary 2D elements in a performant way.
---@class ui.Canvas : ui.Component
---@field numElements integer (Read-only) Returns the number of drawable elements present on this canvas.
ui.Canvas = {}

---Creates a new canvas on the specified parent.
---
---Warning: Creating a component can fail if there's already a component on that parent with the same category ID and
---dynamic ID, or if those are omitted and the application is unable to generate a valid ID for the component.
---@param parent ui.ComponentCollection Parent component to create this canvas in.
---@param categoryID? integer Category ID used to identify this component. Defaults to the parent's category ID if not specified.
---@param dynamicID? integer Dynamic ID used to identify this component. Defaults to auto-incrementing from the parent's dynamic ID if not specified.
---@return ui.Canvas # The newly created canvas. The caller must set its layout and visual information afterwards.
function ui.Canvas.new(parent, categoryID, dynamicID) end

---Adds a line to the list of drawable elements for this canvas.
